1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,820
(Howard:)I'm gonna ask her to marry me.

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,250
(Leonard:)Marry you?
What?
Yeah.

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:08,820
(Howard:)I just need to figure out the
right time to pop the question.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:12,730
(Leonard:)Oh, I'd wait.
No rush, no rush.

5
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,210
(Howard(phone rings):)Oh, great. It's my cousin David
about the ring.

6
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:18,400
(Howard(phone rings):)Hey, David, what'd you find?

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,100
Sure, a half a caret's fine.

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,170
(Howard(phone rings):)Her freakishly small hands
make anything look big.

9
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,410
(Howard(phone rings):)It's one of the reasons
I love her.

10
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:33,350
(Leonard:)Man, he's going
to be blindsided.

11
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:37,720
(Raj:)I know. It'll be awful.

12
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:40,120
(Sheldon:)Why are you smiling?

13
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,190
(Leonard:)Yeah, Raj, why?

14
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:46,990
(Raj:)Uh, a smile means something
different in my country.

15
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,930
(Raj:)You know, tears of joy,
smile of sadness.

16
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:54,230
(Raj:)India's a goofy place.

17
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:58,810
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm back to trains.

